Article 2 (Items of Project Evaluation) The items of project evaluation under Article 9 (2) of the Assistance for Non-Profit, Non-Governmental Organizations Act (hereinafter referred to as the "Act") shall be as follows: <Amended on Jul. 26, 2017; May 1, 2023>
1. The implementation records and results of projects under subparagraph 1 of Article 11 of the Enforcement Decree of the Assistance for Non-Profit, Non-Governmental Organizations Act (hereinafter referred to as the "Decree");
2. The appropriateness of the contents of self-evaluations under subparagraph 2 of Article 11 of the Decree;
3. The appropriateness of accounting reports on project expenditures under subparagraph 3 of Article 11 of the Decree;
4. Other matters determined to be necessary for project evaluation by the Minister of the Interior and Safety; the Mayor of a Special Metropolitan City, Metropolitan City, or Special Self-Governing City, or the Governor of a Do or Special Self-Governing Do (hereinafter referred to as a "Mayor/Do Governor"); or the head of a large city with a population of at least one million under Article 198 (2) 1 of the Local Autonomy Act (hereinafter referred to as a "special-case city").
